            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How long can you cut for?",
            "text": "<p>The batteries have a 30 minute run time each. As this mower is supplied with two batteries you can can expect to mow for up to 1 hour.</p><p>The LawnMaster MX 24V 34cm Cordless Lawn Mower has Intelligent Battery Management adjusting power delivery according to the grass conditions. Delivering extra power in tougher conditions and reserving battery life during lighter cutting. </p><p>You can easily check battery capacity at the touch of a button, whilst you're mowing too.</p><p>N.B. With the supplied 1hr fast charger, you can also charge one battery while using the other one for almost continuous runtime.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
